The only way to actually enable `OmitEmptyPsk` is by specifying it in the `UConn` config:

```go
tlsConfig := &utls.Config{OmitEmptyPsk: true}
conn := utls.UClient(rawConn, tlsConfig, tls.HelloCustom)
// ...
```

